                <p>
                    Custom web applications are designed to address your unique business requirements, streamline operations, and improve customer experiences. Unlike off-the-shelf software, custom web applications provide flexibility, scalability, and seamless integration with your existing business systems. At IFOX, we develop secure, high-performance web applications that help businesses automate processes, increase productivity, and achieve long-term success.
                </p>
                <ul class="list-unstyled">
                    <li>
                        <p><i class="bi bi-check2-circle color"></i>  Requirement Analysis : Understand your business processes and define application objectives to build a solution that meets your specific needs.</p>
                    </li>
                    <li>
